{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Snowflake.SnowflakeCLI","latestVersion":"3.31.0.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A command-line tool for Snowflake developers to create, manage, update, and view apps running on Snowflake across workloads such as Streamlit in Snowflake, the Snowflake Native App Framework, Snowpark Container Services, and Snowpark.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.snowflake.com/en/legal/terms-of-service/","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A command-line tool for Snowflake developers to create, manage, update, and view apps running on Snowflake across workloads such as Streamlit in Snowflake, the Snowflake Native App Framework, Snowpark Container Services, and Snowpark.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.snowflake.com/en/legal/terms-of-service/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Snowflake CLI is an open-source command-line tool explicitly designed for developer-centric workloads in addition to SQL operations. It is a flexible and extensible tool that can accommodate modern development practices and technologies.\nWith Snowflake CLI, developers can create, manage, update, and view apps running on Snowflake across workloads such as Streamlit in Snowflake, the Snowflake Native App Framework, Snowpark Container Services, and Snowpark. It supports a range of Snowflake features, including user-defined functions, stored procedures, Streamlit in Snowflake, and SQL execution.","name":"Snowflake CLI","packageUrl":"https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/index","publisher":"Snowflake, Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.snowflake.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://docs.snowflake.com/en/release-notes/clients-drivers/snowflake-cli-2026","tags":["database","snowflake","sql"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"面向 Snowflake 开发者的命令行工具，用于创建、管理、更新和查看运行在 Snowflake 平台上的应用，支持 Streamlit in Snowflake、Snowflake 原生应用框架、Snowpark 容器服务和 Snowpark 等工作负载。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Snowflake CLI 是一款专为开发者设计的开源命令行工具，除支持 SQL 操作外，更专注于开发工作负载场景。作为灵活可扩展的工具，它能完美适配现代开发实践与技术栈。\n通过 Snowflake CLI，开发者可以针对以下工作负载创建、管理、更新和查看运行在 Snowflake 平台的应用：Snowflake 中的 Streamlit、原生应用框架、Snowpark 容器服务以及 Snowpark 开发。该工具全面支持 Snowflake 多项特性，包括用户自定义函数、存储过程、Streamlit in Snowflake 应用以及 SQL 脚本执行。","tags":["snowflake","sql","数据库"]}},"longDescription":"Snowflake CLI is an open-source command-line tool explicitly designed for developer-centric workloads in addition to SQL operations. It is a flexible and extensible tool that can accommodate modern development practices and technologies.\nWith Snowflake CLI, developers can create, manage, update, and view apps running on Snowflake across workloads such as Streamlit in Snowflake, the Snowflake Native App Framework, Snowpark Container Services, and Snowpark. It supports a range of Snowflake features, including user-defined functions, stored procedures, Streamlit in Snowflake, and SQL execution.","name":"Snowflake CLI","packageUrl":"https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/index","publisher":"Snowflake, Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.snowflake.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://docs.snowflake.com/en/release-notes/clients-drivers/snowflake-cli-2026","tags":["database","snowflake","sql"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.31.0.0/app.json","detailSha256":"d9765e9ddbdb859897d487db5ba1600ddce7a18f211e24a635d21920720291fa","releaseDate":"2026-10-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.31.0.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.30.0.0/app.json","detailSha256":"43d369291ed08ab8f60702bd06492d0d978c4fcf297893ed0814599748065612","releaseDate":"2026-10-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.30.0.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.29.0.0/app.json","detailSha256":"31be2cf3c6b79df6c7a884a876fc3cc8193dd657ef15463b4ccf066bbe173a56","releaseDate":"2026-10-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":